ers/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.admin-component-easy-access/commits/11bb7a8ff9f9d0597a4fbe6fe2e445861e1843e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T21:13:15Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T21:13:31Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"fix: regenerate package-lock.json with npm 10 for CI compatibility\n\nnpm 11 pruned the auto-installed peer dependencies @emnapi/core and\n@emnapi/runtime (required by the optional @napi-rs/wasm-runtime, pulled\nin via @rolldown/binding-wasm32-wasi) from the lock file. The CI runner\nuses npm 10.9.8, which considers them mandatory, so `npm ci` failed with\nEUSAGE \"Missing: @emnapi/core@1.11.3 from lock file\".\n\nRegenerated with npm 10.9.8; `npm ci` now succeeds under both npm 10.9.8\nand npm 11.6.2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"91ac4ae9f294afdc9f4744d27dfe7c6823f0c1dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.admin-component-easy-access/git/trees/91ac4ae9f294afdc9f4744d27dfe7c6823f0c1dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.admin-component-easy-access/git/commits/11bb7a8ff9f9d0597a4fbe6fe2e445861e1843e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","no