il Patel"},"message":"build: Default the dev MFE config API URL to local.openedx.io\n\nFetching MFE config from local.openedx.io:8000 instead of localhost:8000\nkeeps the LMS, Studio, and MFEs under one *.local.openedx.io domain, which\navoids localhost-specific CORS/cookie carve-outs and better matches a\nproduction setup.\n\nWorks with Tutor dev (whose default LMS host is local.openedx.io) and with\nthe upcoming openedx-platform bare-metal development.py config.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3acc62c0f1c6e4efc6874bc206834e6ce25537a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learner-dashboard/git/trees/3acc62c0f1c6e4efc6874bc206834e6ce25537a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learner-dashboard/git/commits/48e02b87a764e18b3a56826ee6cde7d409b81a6a","verification":{"payload":"tree 3acc62c0f1c6e4efc6874bc206834e6ce25537a9\nparent 4db759ddb5dd2837aaebd5e1dae6fd76b739ca87\nauthor Feanil Patel <feanil@axim.org> 1786035282 -0400\ncommitter Feanil Patel <feanil@axim.org> 1786035282 -0400\n\nbuild: Default the dev MFE config API URL to local.openedx.io\n\nFetching MFE config from local.openedx.io:8000 instead of localhost:8000\nkeeps the LMS, Studio, and MFEs under one *.local.openedx.io domain, which\navoids localhost-specific CORS/cookie carve-outs and better matches a\nproduction setup.\n\nWorks with Tutor dev (whose default LMS host is local.openedx.io) and with\nthe upcoming openedx-platform bare-metal development.py config.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglcBDQ9rliT2kx8WFoOW4vSlEaG\noJlB7ebCkwaIN8IboAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFvh4LTWkUoFGCJIFzbpOmw03oIhcwOj5Fd47iVK7M1xeUkrgGIdoKxZ7vFpqpiMh1\niij92KXaxa9pKJkgTYeg8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-06T17:00:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_ur