fills\n  - Add AstNode enum for CSS AST representation\n  - Add compile_ast() function mirroring upstream compileAst()\n  - Add load_design_system() mirroring upstream __unstable__loadDesignSystem()\n  - Add CJS/ESM dual resolver pattern (resolve_js_esm, resolve_js_cjs)\n  - Update CompileOptions with polyfills field\n- All tests pass: 60 ecosystem tests, 11 plugin tests\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/5956082d-0c25-4e93-933d-01e183d0fd7f\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor: optimize Vec allocations in AstNode::to_css and compile_ast\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/5956082d-0c25-4e93-933d-01e183d0fd7f\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: complete @tailwindcss-node Rust migration with env, optimize, instrumentation modules\n\n- Add env.rs: port env.ts - DEBUG env var resolution with 12 unit tests\n- Add optimize.rs: port optimize.ts - CSS optimization via lightningcss with 14 unit tests\n  - Two-pass transform for adjacent rule merging\n  - @media not fix applied after transformation\n  - Browser targets: Safari 16.4, Firefox 128, Chrome 111\n  - Feature flags: include Nesting+MediaQueries, exclude LogicalProperties+DirSelector+LightDark\n- Add instrumentation.rs: port instrumentation.ts - performance profiling with 17 unit tests\n  - hit(), start(), end(), reset(), report() API\n  - Nested timer hierarchy with depth-based indentation\n  - Auto-ends pending timers on report()\n  - ANSI-stripped report for testing\n- Update lib.rs: expose all new modules with full doc links\n- Update Cargo.toml: add lightningcss dependency\n- Total: 100 unit tests + 4 doctests, all passing, clippy clean\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/12ae45c9-6fd2-4cb4-bde1-a1b527f3074a\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test: move tailwind crate tests to integration suite\n\n