nlist it in package.json, causing E2E build failures on all platforms.\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/ef181653-74d3-402c-982b-2e073436ebb4\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor: update auto-import configurations and clean up unused visualizer plugin\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor: remove unused remote icon imports from Rust and Vue examples\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: update persistent cache configuration handling in FarmfePluginIcons\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: fix CI E2E example test failures in compress, icons, and wasm examples\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/5da598aa-0b88-4ed2-b8b4-ea256acf9bf4\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: simplify rust-plugin-url farm config to avoid Windows crash\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/5da598aa-0b88-4ed2-b8b4-ea256acf9bf4\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: prevent e2e test failures in compress preview and icons start\n\n- compress plugin: skip resources with `emitted = true` in finalize_resources.\n  Farm''s runtime plugin marks `farm_internal_runtime_index.*.js` as emitted\n  (inlined into HTML), so the compress plugin was creating orphaned .br/.gz\n  files with no original .js counterpart. The preview server then served\n  index.html (SPA fallback) for those JS requests, causing parse errors in\n  the browser and failing the e2e test.\n\n- icons plugin (cache/mod.rs): replace unwrap() on DiskCache::build() with\n  retry-with-exponential-backoff (5 retries, 50-1600ms). When two Farm\n  processes share the same sled lock file (EAGAIN/WouldBlock), the build\n  now degrades gracefully to no-disk-cache instead of panicking, fixing\n  the icons-react and icons-vue start test failures.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: enhance E2E testing framework and documentation for examples\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: improve error logging for disk cache initialization in icon plugin\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: enhance Rust and JS plugin integration, improve example build scripts, and update type definitions\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: reorder fields in CompilationContext to prevent Access Violation on Windows\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Refactor DTS generation in auto-import and react-components plugins\n\n- Introduced a new `DtsEntry` struct to encapsulate declaration name, source, and code for better organization.\n- Replaced direct string concatenation with a vector of `DtsEntry` instances, allowing for sorting and cleaner code generation.\n- Updated `generate_dts` function in both `generate_dts.rs` files to utilize the new struct for improved readability and maintainability.\n\nEnhance compression plugin for parallel processing\n\n- Modified the compression plugin to use a channel for handling results from parallel compression tasks.\n- Replaced the use of `par_iter` with `iter_mut` to allow mutable access to resources during compression.\n- Improved error handling for result collection from parallel tasks.\n\nClean up WASM plugin by removing unused cache functionality\n\n- Removed the `CachedStaticAssets` struct and related caching logic from the WASM plugin.\n- Simplified the plugin implementation by focusing on the core functionality without caching overhead.\n\nUpdate build scripts to support specific example builds\n\n- Enhanced the `buildExamples` function to accept an optional `example` parameter for targeted builds.\n- Added argument parsing for the `--example` flag in the test examples script to facilitate example-specific testing.\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat(worker): enhance worker functionality and inline support\n\n- Added new CSS styles for displaying worker cases and their statuses.\n- Updated the Main component to accept worker results and display them.\n- Refactored the worker implementation to expose a simpler API using Comlink.\n- Introduced a new shared worker implementation to handle messages.\n- Removed the old cache implementation and replaced it with a new code generation module.\n- Implemented worker URL computation and entry name generation for better output management.\n- Enhanced the plugin to handle inline workers and dynamic entries more effectively.\n- Added resource patching to replace inline worker placeholders with actual base64-encoded content.\n- Introduced options struct for better configuration management.\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: add test worker integration and update sourcemap documentation\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: remove unused injected value declaration for runtime target environment\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: remove duplicate swc_eq_ignore_macros entry in Cargo.lock\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/2df11c5a-83d1-466e-848b-1de3bd450e40\n\n* fix: regenerate Cargo.lock and address local lint blockers\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/2df11c5a-83d1-466e-848b-1de3bd450e40\n\n* fix: restore var cachedModuleResult inside if block and remove extra parens in module-system.ts to match origin/main and fix concatenate_module_test\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/7699b0a7-0e8f-437e-bab7-1976e7a9b