isk examples; ignore post-success console errors; preserve error messages across IPC\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/bffe1999-27a7-4aa3-9778-997967ee5cbf\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Refactor code for improved readability and maintainability\n\n- Simplified conditional checks and formatting in library.rs\n- Consolidated import statements in disk.rs\n- Removed unnecessary whitespace in partial_bundling.rs\n- Streamlined function calls and formatting in lib.rs and other files\n- Added detailed E2E process cleanup logic in process-cleanup.mjs\n- Enhanced E2E testing scripts to handle stale processes and improve logging\n- Introduced new types for auto-import and react components\n- Updated screenshots and other assets for consistency\n\n* fix(e2e): address cross-platform ci failures\n\n* feat(docs): add troubleshooting guide for Rust Plugin Worker E2E URL mismatch\nfix(e2e): improve process termination handling in watchAndTest function\nfix(rust): stabilize worker entry name computation for different queries and path separators\nchore: update app window screenshot\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: brightwu <1521488775@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: wumingliang <wumingliang.9801@bytedance.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs: update CI optimization rollout plan\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/21e400a0-b261-4a33-afdd-d0db04cfef73\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* ci: split rust builds and add ci profile cache\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/75203caf-8750-4f4c-a299-eb25b2912785\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* ci: set explicit rust workflow permissions\n\nAg