 Fix non_canonical_partial_ord_impl clippy errors in compiler test\n- Fix assert_eq! with literal bool clippy errors in core cache tests\n- Fix unnecessary to_string clippy errors in core cache tests\n- Fix format string clippy errors in auto-import plugin\n- Fix useless vec! clippy error in auto-import plugin\n- Fix typos: complier→compiler, custon→custom, buttton→button\n- Add valid technical terms to cspell dictionary\n- Add patches/** to cspell ignorePaths (vendored serde crate)\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/8f6b1a94-a47c-451a-b530-92c6b77f7bd5\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: remove nested pnpm workspace/lock files from rust plugins and move playgrounds to examples\n\n- Remove pnpm-workspace.yaml from 12 rust plugins (auto-import, compress, icons, image, modular-import, react-components, strip, svgr, url, virtual, wasm, worker)\n- Remove pnpm-lock.yaml from 13 rust plugins (auto-import, compress, icons, image, modular-import, react-components, strip, svgr, url, virtual, wasm, worker, yaml)\n- Move 10 playground directories to examples/ as rust-plugin-{name}\n- Update moved playground package.json names to @farmfe-examples/rust-plugin-{name}\n- Remove \"play\" and \"build:wasm\" scripts from parent plugin package.json files\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/54b99276-f6e1-45d4-b760-335cb85873de\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: update example deps to workspace:*, fix broken links, add ready workflow\n\n- Update all rust-plugin examples to use workspace:* for @farmfe/cli,\n  @farmfe/core, @farmfe/plugin-react, and @farmfe/js-plugin-less\n- Remove broken \"browser\": \"link:@unocss/preset-icons/browser\" from\n  react-components example\n- Remove broken \"rust-wasm\": \"link:./wasm\" from wasm example and\n  update source to remove rust-wasm import\n- Update pnpm-lock.yaml with new workspace example packages\n- Add .github/workflows/ready.yaml that runs npm run ready on PRs\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/15be78ab-64d1-46bd-b348-42bc58026786\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: add missing words to cspell dictionary (astro, bincode, reqwest)\n\n* refactor: move playground-react and playground-vue from icons plugin to examples\n\n* fix: update vue example to use #root instead of #app for e2e test compatibility\n\n* refactor: move auto-import playgrounds from rust-plugins to examples and update dependencies\n\n* refactor: simplify build scripts by removing redundant cargo-name arguments\n\n* fix: fix CI test failure, remove duplicate ready workflow, add dts plugin to CI/release\n\n- Fix test_find_local_components: use CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR instead of\n  env::current_dir() to reliably locate the example fixtures after\n  playground was moved to examples/rust-plugin-react-components\n- Remove duplicate .github/workflows/ready.yaml (duplicates existing CI checks)\n- Add dts rust-plugin to rust-build.yaml (build loops + upload artifact)\n- Add dts rust-plugin to ci.yaml (download artifact + check artifacts matrix)\n- Add dts rust-plugin to release.yaml (move artifacts + verify)\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/487030c2-a03b-46ea-be29-a9f7a9c31849\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: change invalid targetEnv ''library-node'' to ''node'' in babel and react-compiler JS plugins\n\nThe ''library-node'' targetEnv was removed from Farm''s schema validation.\nBoth plugins migrated from the plugins repo still used this invalid value,\ncausing ''farm build'' to fail with a validation error during the JS plugins\nbuild phase of ''npm run ready''.\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/effae6ef-bab7-4cc9-bc08-5ed2bc51a4b9\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: add missing @farmfe/js-plugin-visualizer dependency to auto-import examples\n\nThe rust-plugin-auto-import-react and rust-plugin-auto-import-vue examples\nimport @farmfe/js-plugin-visualizer in their farm.config.ts but did not\nlist it in package.json, causing E2E build failures on all platforms.\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/ef181653-74d3-402c-982b-2e073436ebb4\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor: update auto-import configurations and clean up unused visualizer plugin\n\n* refactor: remove unused remote icon imports from Rust and Vue examples\n\n* fix: update persistent cache configuration handling in FarmfePluginIcons\n\n* fix: fix CI E2E example test failures in compress, icons, and wasm examples\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/5da598aa-0b88-4ed2-b8b4-ea256acf9bf4\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: simplify rust-plugin-url farm config to avoid Windows crash\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/5da598aa-0b88-4ed2-b8b4-ea256acf9bf4\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: prevent e2e test failures in compress preview and icons start\n\n- compress plugin: skip resources with `emitted = true` in finalize_resources.\n  Farm''s runtime plugin marks `farm_internal_runtime_index.*.js` as emitted\n  (inlined into HTML), so the compress plugin was creating orphaned .br/.gz\n  files with no original .js counterpart. The preview server then served\n  index.html (SPA fallback) for those JS requests, causing parse errors in\n  the browser and failing the e2e test.\n\n- icons plugin (cache/mod.rs): replace unwrap() on DiskCache::build() with\n  retry-with-exponential-backoff (5 retries, 50-1600ms). When two Farm\n  processes share the same sled lock file (EAGAIN/WouldBlock), the build\n  now degrades gracefully to no-disk-cache instead of panicking, fixing\n  the icons-react and icons-vue start test failures.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: enhance E2E testing framework and documentation for examples\n\n* fix: improve error logging for disk cache initialization in icon plugin\n\n* feat: enhance Rust and JS plugin integration, improve example build scripts, and update type definitions\n\n* fix: reorder fields in CompilationContext to prevent Access Violation on Windows\n\n* Refactor DTS generation in auto-import and react-components plugins\n\n- Introduced a new `DtsEntry` struct to encapsulate declaration name, source, and code for better organization.\n- Replaced direct string concatenation with a vector of `DtsEntry` instances, allowing for sorting and cleaner code generation.\n- Updated `generate_dts` function in both `generate_dts.rs` files to utilize the new struct for improved readability and maintainability.\n\nEnhance compression plugin for parallel processing\n\n- Modified the compression plugin to use a channel for handling results from parallel compression tasks.\n- Replaced the use of `par_iter` with `iter_mut` to allow mutable access to resources during compression.\n- Improved error handling for result collection from parallel tasks.\n\nClean up WASM plugin by removing unused cache functionality\n\n- Removed the `CachedStaticAssets` struct and related caching logic from the WASM plugin.\n- Simplified the plugin implementation by focusing on the core functionality without caching overhead.\n\nUpdate build scripts to support specific example builds\n\n- Enhanced the `buildExamples` function to accept an optional `example` parameter for targeted builds.\n- Added argument parsing for the `--example` flag in the test examples script to facilitate example-specific testing.\n\n* feat(worker): enhance worker functionality and inline support\n\n- Added new CSS styles for displaying worker cases and their statuses.\n- Updated the Main component to accept worker results and display them.\n- Refactored the worker implementation to expose a simpler API using Comlink.\n- Introduced a new shared worker implementation to handle messages.\n- Removed the old cache implementation and replaced it with a new code generation module.\n- Implemented worker URL computation and entry name generation for better output management.\n- Enhanced the plugin to handle inline workers and dynamic entries more effectively.\n- Added resource patching to replace inline worker placeholders with actual base64-encoded content.\n- Introduced options struct for better configuration management.\n\n* feat: add test worker integration and update sourcemap documentation\n\n* fix: remove unused injected value declaration for runtime target environment\n\n* Initial plan\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: resolve all clippy errors in farmfe_plugin_icons\n\n- Remove returning let bindings (preact.rs, react.rs, common.rs)\n- Replace look-around regex with capture group approach (solid.rs)\n- Use inline format variables throughout\n- Fix loop-that-never-loops with Iterator::next (common.rs)\n- Use std::mem::swap for variable swapping (icon_to_svg.rs)\n- Use proper pattern matching instead of unwrap after is_none (icon_to_svg.rs)\n- Remove unneeded return statements (cache/mod.rs)\n- Remove unnecessary to_string (cache/mod.rs)\n- Use strip_prefix instead of manual prefix stripping (cache/mod.rs)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Migrate all rust and js plugins from farm-fe/plugins repo\n\nRust plugins migrated: auto-import, compress, dsv, icons, image, mdx,\nmodular-import, react-components, strip, svgr, url, virtual, wasm, worker, yaml\n\nJS plugins migrated: babel, copy, react-compiler, vuetify\n\n- Updated Cargo.toml deps from workspace refs to path-based refs\n- Pinned serde/rmp-serde versions for swc_common compatibility\n- Fixed clippy errors across all new plugins\n- Ran cargo fmt on all new code\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/9d3c974c-f217-47ce-8281-c34a46fab634\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: resolve all clippy errors in farmfe_plugin_virtual and farmfe_plugin_auto_import\n\n- Use strip_prefix() instead of manual prefix stripping (virtual/lib.rs)\n- Use is_some_and() instead of map_or(false, ...) (virtual/utils.rs)\n- Change &Vec<T> params to &[T] slices (4 occurrences)\n- Replace is_none()/unwrap() with unwrap_or()/if-let patterns\n- Remove needless return statements\n- Derive Default for ExportType enum\n- Use if-let instead of single-arm match\n- Replace manual char comparison with array pattern\n- Remove redundant ''static lifetime on constants\n- Remove .to_string() in println! args for Display types\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: resolve all clippy errors across migrated rust plugins\n\nFix clippy errors in: modular-import, worker, react-components, strip,\nsvgr, url, image, virtual, auto-import.\n\nAll rust plugins now pass cargo clippy and cargo fmt.\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/4c901bb4-9792-4471-86f3-fb23d03c5126\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: update package.json for migrated plugins and fix biome lint errors\n\n- Update all new rust plugin package.json: set @farmfe/plugin-tools to workspace:*,\n  update repository/homepage/bugs URLs to farm-fe/farm\n- Update JS plugin package.json: fix workspace references\n- Fix all biome lint errors in babel, copy, react-compiler, vuetify JS plugins\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/4c901bb4-9792-4471-86f3-fb23d03c5126\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* ci: add 15 new migrated rust plugins to CI workflows\n\nAdd build, upload, download, check, and release steps for:\nauto-import, compress, dsv, icons, image, mdx, modular-import,\nreact-components, strip, svgr, url, virtual, wasm, worker, yaml\n\n- rust-build.yaml: Add plugins to docker, default, and custom builds\n  using shell loops; add upload-artifact steps for each plugin\n- ci.yaml: Add download-artifact steps in examples-test job;\n  add plugin entries to check-plugin-artifacts matrix\n- release.yaml: Add mv and test -f lines for new plugin artifacts\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: update CI workflows and release config for migrated plugins\n\n- Update rust-build.yaml to build all 15 new rust plugins\n- Update ci.yaml with download-artifact steps and artifact checks\n- Update release.yaml with artifact move and verification for new plugins\n- Update release-plz.toml to disable crates.io release for new plugins\n- Fix default build step path navigation for plugin build loop\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/4c901bb4-9792-4471-86f3-fb23d03c5126\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: update lockfile\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: patch serde for backward-compat __private module and fix Wtf8Atom API changes\n\n- Add patches/serde with backward-compatible __private module alias for\n  older swc_common versions (0.33.26, 0.37.5, 5.0.1) used transitively\n  by svgr-rs, fervid, and mdxjs\n- Fix react-components: Wtf8Atom .as_ref() -> .to_string() for named imports\n- Fix auto-import: Wtf8Atom .to_string() -> .to_string_lossy().into_owned()\n- Run cargo fmt to fix formatting in mangle_exports\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/4a6abf03-0779-41bb-ae15-12d776f18f9f\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.norep