"html_url":"https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/commit/7571ee3fc14fc41cb218778ee0558c1332b57dbc","sha":"7571ee3fc14fc41cb218778ee0558c1332b57dbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farm-fe/farm/commits/7571ee3fc14fc41cb218778ee0558c1332b57dbc"}],"sha":"4684bc89fcc682fd4bb05ddbab2c624ebee07d3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farm-fe/farm/commits/4684bc89fcc682fd4bb05ddbab2c624ebee07d3c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farm-fe/farm/commits/7571ee3fc14fc41cb218778ee0558c1332b57dbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-31T04:53:24Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Copilot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T04:53:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add support for emitting multiple resources in farm library mode (#2280)\n\n* Initial plan\n\n* feat: support emitting multiple resources in library mode\n\n- Fix render_resource_pot to handle non-entry resource pots gracefully\n  instead of panicking, by finding a root module in the dependency subgraph\n- Fix MultipleBundle config to use default partial bundling settings\n  instead of forcing target_min_size=usize::MAX which prevented code splitting\n- Add CSS test fixture for library mode verifying both JS and CSS resources\n  are properly emitted\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/4cfc6c18-bc23-4573-9425-1419869192c5\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor: address code review feedback - improve clarity of iterator patterns\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/4cfc6c18-bc23-4573-9425-1419869192c5\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test: add MultipleBundle and BundleLess test fixtures for library mode\n\nAdd test fixtures that verify cross-file import/export relationships:\n\n- MultipleBundle: Entry with static imports (bundled together) and a\n  dynamic import that creates a separate chunk, testing the import()\n  reference between emitted files\n- BundleLess: Each module emitted as its own file with import/export\n  statements preserved between them (entry imports from utils and\n  constants modules, and re-exports their symbols)\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/54467bc4-38ee-40dc-9750-9b97126fa0ad\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor: address code review - use reference HashSet and improve error messages\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/54467bc4-38ee-40dc-9750-9b97126fa0ad\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Changes before error encountered\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/9bc87553-89c1-4dd3-ae14-0116d25c091b\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: preserve directory structure in bundle-less mode for library output\n\nFor bundle-less mode (target_min_size=0), derive resource pot names from\nmodule paths instead of base_resource_pot_name. This preserves the original\nsource directory structure in the output (e.g., lib/utils.ts → lib/utils.js\ninstead of index-hash.js).\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/61c6813c-187c-411e-8948-eef1ba76ba92\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: address code review - improve path handling and assertion diagnostics\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/61c6813c-187c-411e-8948-eef1ba76ba92\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: remove hash from bundle-less output filenames by default\n\nIn bundle-less mode, each module has its own resource pot with a unique\nname already, so the auto-appended name_hash is unnecessary. Hashes are\nonly added when the user explicitly configures [hash] or [contentHash]\nin the output filename config.\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/c25356fa-e845-4cba-b907-9c8aad8beca0\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: replace import sources with actual output resource paths in library mode\n\nIn library mode (multiple-bundle and bundle-less), import sources that reference\nother resource pots (like `import { add } from \"shared.ts\"`) are now replaced with\nactual relative paths to the output resource files (like `import { add } from \"./index-2c6c8c27.js\"`).\n\nImplementation uses a two-phase approach:\n1. During render_resource_pot, insert FARM_BUNDLE_PLACEHOLDER:: markers for\n   non-external script module import sources in the AST\n2. After all resources are generated and filenames assigned, replace placeholders\n   with computed relative paths to the target resource files\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/b4a82b3a-8032-49d6-b4bf-8948cde5c838\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: resolve CI test failures - clippy error, Windows path separators, dead code\n\n1. Fix clippy::uninlined_format_args error in render_resource_pots.rs:336\n   - Changed format!(\"{}{}\", FARM_BUNDLE_PLACEHOLDER_PREFIX, module_id) to\n     format!(\"{FARM_BUNDLE_PLACEHOLDER_PREFIX}{module_id}\")\n\n2. Fix Windows test failure in library_bundle_type_test\n   - In collect_files_recursive(), normalize path separators to forward slashes\n   - Windows produces \"lib\\constants.js\" but resource names use \"lib/constants.js\"\n\n3. Remove unused library_bundle_type field from FarmPluginLibrary struct\n   - Was stored but never read (config.output.library_bundle_type accessed directly)\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/49e4f5a6-ea28-469f-9d5f-0ccaa2943d74\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: use to_string_lossy() for Wtf8Atom values in library plugin placeholder replacement\n\nIn swc_atoms v9+, Str.value is Wtf8Atom which doesn''t implement Display/ToString.\nReplace .to_string() with .to_string_lossy().into_owned() for import/export source\nvalue extraction in replace_internal_import_sources_with_placeholders().\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/811450fc-0925-495a-be36-add76c670155\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: brightwu <1521488775@qq.com>","tree":{"sha":"645dabb1f1860e172bd488993a431dce54b2bbdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farm-fe/farm/git/trees/645dabb1f1860e172bd488993a431dce54b2bbdc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farm-fe/farm/git/commits/7571ee3fc14fc41cb218778ee0558c1332b57dbc","verification":{"payload":"tree 645dabb1f1860e172bd488993a431dce54b2bbdc\nparent a378d9c3645a62b47f0dc87c0c0693977d55699b\nauthor Copilot <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com> 1774932804 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774932804 +0800\n\nfeat: add support for emitting multiple resources in farm library mode (#2280)\n\n* Initial plan\n\n* feat: support emitting multiple resources in library mode\n\n- Fix render_resource_pot to handle non-entry resource pots gracefully\n  instead of panicking, by finding a root module in the dependency subgraph\n- Fix MultipleBundle config to use default partial bundling settings\n  instead of forcing target_min_size=usize::MAX which prevented code splitting\n- Add CSS test fixture for library mode verifying both JS and CSS resources\n  are properly emitted\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/4cfc6c18-bc23-4573-9425-1419869192c5\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor: address code review feedback - improve clarity of iterator patterns\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/4cfc6c18-bc23-4573-9425-1419869192c5\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test: add MultipleBundle and BundleLess test fixtures for library mode\n\nAdd test fixtures that verify cross-file import/export relationships:\n\n- MultipleBundle: Entry with static imports (bundled together) and a\n  dynamic import that creates a separate chunk, testing the import()\n  reference between emitted files\n- BundleLess: Each module emitted as its own file with import/export\n  statements preserved between them (entry imports from utils and\n  constants modules, and re-exports their symbols)\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/54467bc4-38ee-40dc-9750-9b97126fa0ad\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor: address code review - use reference HashSet and improve error messages\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/54467bc4-38ee-40dc-9750-9b97126fa0ad\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Changes before erro