generated and filenames assigned, replace placeholders\n   with computed relative paths to the target resource files\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/b4a82b3a-8032-49d6-b4bf-8948cde5c838\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: resolve CI test failures - clippy error, Windows path separators, dead code\n\n1. Fix clippy::uninlined_format_args error in render_resource_pots.rs:336\n   - Changed format!(\"{}{}\", FARM_BUNDLE_PLACEHOLDER_PREFIX, module_id) to\n     format!(\"{FARM_BUNDLE_PLACEHOLDER_PREFIX}{module_id}\")\n\n2. Fix Windows test failure in library_bundle_type_test\n   - In collect_files_recursive(), normalize path separators to forward slashes\n   - Windows produces \"lib\\constants.js\" but resource names use \"lib/constants.js\"\n\n3. Remove unused library_bundle_type field from FarmPluginLibrary struct\n   - Was stored but never read (config.output.library_bundle_type accessed directly)\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/49e4f5a6-ea28-469f-9d5f-0ccaa2943d74\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: use to_string_lossy() for Wtf8Atom values in library plugin placeholder replacement\n\nIn swc_atoms v9+, Str.value is Wtf8Atom which doesn''t implement Display/ToString.\nReplace .to_string() with .to_string_lossy().into_owned() for import/export source\nvalue extraction in replace_internal_import_sources_with_placeholders().\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/811450fc-0925-495a-be36-add76c670155\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: brightwu <1521488775@qq.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpy1NECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjuMQAJeGNabQvOgXfsT