ccurate v2 breaking changes\n- Mirror all changes to zh (Chinese) locale\n- Add missing zh config sections for anchor resolution\n- Update workspace refs: pnpm-workspace.yaml, biome.json, package.json, agent config\n\n* config: add vercel.json to point Root Directory to website/\n\n* fix(vercel): remove invalid root field from vercel.json\n\n* chore(vercel): remove vercel.json\n\n* chore: remove js plugin vue/solid and related examples\n\n* docs: add AGENTS.md, update READMEs and CONTRIBUTING with AI tooling info\n\n* chore: add rebase-commit-push-pr skill\n\n* chore: update lockfile\n\n* chore: add creating-changesets skill and update check ignores\n\n* chore: update @farmfe/plugin-worker version to 2.0.0-beta.0 in package.json and pnpm-lock.yaml\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Initial plan\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Changes before error encountered\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/farm-fe/farm/sessions/d708c326-abeb-4cdd-87a6-16f729c7ec94\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Revert unintended binding.cjs changes\n\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: wre232114 <8372439+wre232114@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: brightwu <1521488775@qq.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3e8ef43d2d47df722edc774846d2f24067af00d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farm-fe/farm/git/trees/c3e8ef43d2d47df722edc774846d2f24067af00d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farm-fe/farm/git/commits/2f9ef0ec283cf22dd41ab25c8d007d38ae286304","verification":{"payload":"tree c3e8ef43d2d47df722edc774846d2f24067af00d\nparent fec41256b7183338b5cba1d625334787a51dfa45\nauthor Copilot <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com> 1774886599 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774886599 +0800\n\nchore: Updat