), js-plugin.mdx (24 hooks), rust-plugin.mdx (37 hooks)\n- Update tutorials: build (output formats)\n- Update advanced: minification (include/exclude), persistent-cache (envs, globalBuiltinCacheKeyStrategy)\n- Rewrite migration/v1-to-v2.md with accurate v2 breaking changes\n- Mirror all changes to zh (Chinese) locale\n- Add missing zh config sections for anchor resolution\n- Update workspace refs: pnpm-workspace.yaml, biome.json, package.json, agent config\n\n* config: add vercel.json to point Root Directory to website/\n\n* fix(vercel): remove invalid root field from vercel.json\n\n* chore(vercel): remove vercel.json\n\n* chore: remove js plugin vue/solid and related examples\n\n* docs: add AGENTS.md, update READMEs and CONTRIBUTING with AI tooling info\n\n* chore: add rebase-commit-push-pr skill\n\n* chore: update lockfile\n\n* chore: add creating-changesets skill and update check ignores\n\n* chore: update @farmfe/plugin-worker version to 2.0.0-beta.0 in package.json and pnpm-lock.yaml","tree":{"sha":"8a9191141b7eb1a61037dc0c2222b447872b47c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farm-fe/farm/git/trees/8a9191141b7eb1a61037dc0c2222b447872b47c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farm-fe/farm/git/commits/fec41256b7183338b5cba1d625334787a51dfa45","verification":{"payload":"tree 8a9191141b7eb1a61037dc0c2222b447872b47c4\nparent 8bba42649ebe34d95f51d2a46e6e62642440598d\nauthor brightwu <1521488775@qq.com> 1774860531 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774860531 +0800\n\ndocs: sync v2 docs from code and rename docs/ to website/ (#2283)\n\n* docs: v2 documentation setup with v1 archiving and migration guide\n\n- Create v1 documentation version snapshot using Docusaurus versioning\n- Configure version switcher in docusaurus.config.js with v1.x marked as unmaintained\n- Fix imports in versioned docs from relative paths to @site aliases\n- Create comprehensive migration guide (v1-to-v2.md) with:\n  - Overview of breaking changes (config structure, HMR origin valid